{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980000/extras/c7ca2ac8ad70c85750d0d30474d30851.avif?t=1758465410\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728<strong>Game Introduction\u200b\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destined one,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seek the truth hidden in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or raise your sword in defiance against all injustice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter that special &quot;her&quot;,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid deception and entanglement, the choices you make\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you defy the entire world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you still hold fast to your vows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b&quot;Deceptive Love Ballad / The Blasphemous Maiden&quot;\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014A dark fantasy romance GalGame, now begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of the protagonist &quot;Zilin SAI&quot;, gradually unraveling the mysteries of &quot;Heart City&quot; Morodo, meeting a diverse cast of characters, encountering your destined &quot;her&quot;, and embarking on a unique romantic story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u200b</strong>\u2728<strong>Game Genre\uff1a</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVG Visual Novel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word count: Approximately 120,000 words</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total playtime: Approximately 3-5 hours</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728<strong>Game Features\uff1a</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 exquisite character illustrations and CGs</strong></p></li><li><p c